# WS1-08. Source: spec/13-data-inclusion.md §1 DI-1/DI-3/DI-5 (embed yields the
# file's bytes, path relative to the source file), §2 (len is a compile-time
# constant; a local const infers the array type). The file holds "Clorraine\n":
# 10 bytes, first 'C'=67, last '\n'=10, byte sum 937, second byte 'l'=108.
# Also checked by hand from the clc log: DI-7 asks for a build-time size report
# listing every embedded blob and the total.
expect: output
contrast: DATA[9] ==> DATA[8]
contrast-expect: output
--- output
10 67 10 937 10 108
--- contrast-output
10 67 101 937 10 108
